703:* **Multiplier design (M): LD* and filtered LD are PROVED.** FM, Theorem R and Lemma Kern remain valid by the checks above. The new finite-k budget is theta_M=3/(d+1)+d/(4k)+eta, eta>0. The limiting constant remains (1+3/(d+1))/sqrt(2), including 0.919239 at d=9.

